1
00:00:00,930 --> 00:00:04,230
Now the 12 participating countries are here.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,480
Listen to the roar of the crowd, the stadium is completely full.

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:10,190
It has finally begun.

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,990
The International Youth Tournament.

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,860
This is our first step on the world stage.

6
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:21,160
Three years have passed, I can't believe I'll play with Tsubasa-kun again.

7
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,330
Tsubasa-kun.

8
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:24,250
What?

9
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:36,260
This is for Nankatsu's victory.

10
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,220
Misaki-kun.

11
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:51,110
Catch, Misaki-kun.

12
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,530
Misaki-kun.

13
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:59,370
Thanks, Tsubasa-kun.

14
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,910
For Misaki, let's unite on the Japan team. Ozora Tsubasa.

15
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,220
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

16
00:02:35,170 --> 00:02:37,920
~Three years ago~

17
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:39,930
Artist Ichiro Misaki Landscape Paintings Exhibition

18
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:41,680
Mount Bandai: Norikura

19
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,510
Shikoku Karst

20
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:49,940
Episode 8: I Am Taro Misaki

21
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:49,940
Misaki-kun.

22
00:02:50,890 --> 00:02:54,190
It's the last day and still a lot of people have come.

23
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:57,440
Oh, Shinonari-san, thank you from the bottom of my heart

24
00:02:57,530 --> 00:03:02,410
for organizing such a magnificent and splendid exhibition.

25
00:03:02,490 --> 00:03:04,450
You're welcome, I thank you for your talent.

26
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:06,950
Shinonari-kun, it's been a long time.

27
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:09,410
Oh, Yamamura-san.

28
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:12,460
All these works are magnificent.

29
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:13,750
Do you think so too?

30
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:15,380
Thank you very much.

31
00:03:15,790 --> 00:03:17,460
But you know...

32
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:22,680
You've painted landscapes of mountains from all over Japan,

33
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:24,970
but why is there no Mount Fuji?

34
00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:29,430
Please tell us why, Misaki-kun?

35
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,980
Oh, yes.

36
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:34,480
Mount Fuji is the most beautiful mountain in the world.

37
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:38,480
If I paint it, I want to be satisfied with my result.

38
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:43,160
I went there and visited this year, but...

39
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:46,660
I still couldn't quite feel confident.

40
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:51,580
I'm sure you'll soon be able to paint a wonderful work of Mount Fuji.

41
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:54,790
When you do, I'll come to buy it.

42
00:03:56,250 --> 00:03:57,920
Thank you very much.

43
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,010
By the way, Misaki-kun, have you considered studying in France?

44
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:09,770
Yes, thank you for the offer, but I cannot take Taro with me.

45
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:15,190
About that, there is someone who has come to talk to you.

46
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:16,270
Me?

47
00:04:16,900 --> 00:04:17,980
This way, please.

48
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:24,280
It's been a long time, Ichiro-san.

49
00:04:24,820 --> 00:04:26,280
Yumiko!

50
00:04:26,370 --> 00:04:28,950
- Good, defend! - Behind you!

51
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,210
C-Cut him off.

52
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:35,960
I can't, he's too fast.

53
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:37,210
Now.

54
00:04:40,090 --> 00:04:44,090
Nishimine Team

55
00:04:40,550 --> 00:04:44,090
Wow, so this is how a national champion plays.

56
00:04:44,470 --> 00:04:46,890
You're really amazing, Misaki.

57
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:50,600
In the next match, we'll beat the Matsura team like drinking water.

58
00:04:50,890 --> 00:04:54,850
Please Misaki, show us more moves.

59
00:04:55,270 --> 00:04:56,270
Okay.

60
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,360
Hey, guys.

61
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:02,860
Nishimine Team

62
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:01,610
What? Mitsuro was finally found.

63
00:05:01,690 --> 00:05:02,860
It really is him.

64
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:05,320
Sorry I'm late.

65
00:05:06,070 --> 00:05:09,030
My English conversation class just finished.

66
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:12,580
If you're busy, don't push yourself.

67
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:17,750
This kid always skips training for extra classes and tests.

68
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:21,130
Yeah, because of him we had to play with 10 people.

69
00:05:21,710 --> 00:05:25,170
But now Misaki is here, we don't need you.

70
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,180
What? I want to play.

71
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,640
Mitsuro!

72
00:05:28,970 --> 00:05:29,800
Mom.

73
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:31,890
What are you doing here?

74
00:05:32,350 --> 00:05:33,560
His mother came...

75
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:36,690
Your teacher has come and is waiting for you.

76
00:05:36,770 --> 00:05:40,400
But mom, today I want to learn football from Misaki-kun.

77
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,900
Listen to the nonsense coming out of your mouth...

78
00:05:43,230 --> 00:05:46,240
Don't even think about it, you're coming with me now, it's lesson time.

79
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:48,240
But mom.

80
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:54,870
Alright, since he's gone, let's get back to training.

81
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,250
Okay.

82
00:05:58,210 --> 00:05:59,630
Alright, see you tomorrow.

83
00:05:59,710 --> 00:06:01,920
- Goodbye. - Goodbye.

84
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,710
Misaki, come to our house.

85
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:08,130
Your father is still in Tokyo, isn't he?

86
00:06:08,220 --> 00:06:10,430
Ah yes, thank you.

87
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,930
Here you go.

88
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:14,970
Thank you, and sorry for the intrusion.

89
00:06:15,100 --> 00:06:17,520
Don't be shy, eat.

90
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:19,440
Oh, yes, thank you.

91
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:25,150
It's truly incredible, you and your father have traveled all over Japan.

92
00:06:25,230 --> 00:06:28,240
Despite that, you managed to become the country's number one player.

93
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:30,280
He's not just a talented footballer.

94
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:33,740
He's also top of his class in his studies.

95
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:34,950
Mom.

96
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:41,460
You see, you really should strive to be like Misaki-kun, Kazuo. Right, dear?

97
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:42,960
Yes, definitely.

98
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:45,710
I knew you'd say that.

99
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,760
Moms and dads.

100
00:06:50,930 --> 00:06:57,890
Kazuo-kun's mother, Mitsuro-kun's mother, Tsubasa-kun's mother, Ishizaki-kun's mother.

101
00:06:57,980 --> 00:07:02,480
Kodama Restaurant

102
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:02,190
I wonder what my own mother is like.

103
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:09,190
The light...

104
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:12,570
I'm back, Dad, are you here?

105
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:15,580
Yes, I just got back.

106
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:18,000
Taro, have you had dinner?

107
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:21,250
Yes, I ate with Kazuo-kun's family again.

108
00:07:21,330 --> 00:07:23,080
How was the exhibition?

109
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:26,340
Ah yes, it was a great success.

110
00:07:26,590 --> 00:07:28,380
Wonderful.

111
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:31,840
I have to go do my homework.

112
00:07:37,140 --> 00:07:38,220
Taro.

113
00:07:38,310 --> 00:07:41,190
What is it, Dad?

114
00:07:41,770 --> 00:07:44,610
Your mother turned up today.

115
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,610
My mother?

116
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:53,490
I was surprised at first too, I knew she had remarried five years ago.

117
00:07:53,860 --> 00:07:58,620
It's been 11 years since we separated, and I haven't seen her since.

118
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:02,870
But why? Why suddenly would my mother...

119
00:08:03,250 --> 00:08:06,210
I think she saw you on television.

120
00:08:06,290 --> 00:08:07,130
Me?

121
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:13,630
Yes, and she said she wants to take custody of you.

122
00:08:14,130 --> 00:08:16,640
What?

123
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:22,270
I'll take care of Taro.

124
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:25,440
You're still young.

125
00:08:26,110 --> 00:08:28,320
You can start over.

126
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:32,150
I'll take Taro and keep painting pictures nobody buys.

127
00:08:32,530 --> 00:08:36,200
Come, let's never see each other again.

128
00:08:38,030 --> 00:08:39,410
And you, Dad.

129
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:43,120
What did you say?

130
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:44,670
Me?

131
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,290
Maybe I...

132
00:08:47,130 --> 00:08:50,670
can go to France for art education.

133
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,170
France?

134
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:59,180
It was a ready offer, but I said no because I couldn't take you with me.

135
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:02,680
So, you're going to leave me with mom and go to France?

136
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,100
Dad.

137
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:09,770
Taro, you have talent in football.

138
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:10,690
What?

139
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:13,320
But to develop that talent,

140
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:18,910
you need to stay and play in one fixed place.

141
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,200
Dad.

142
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:22,330
Like when we were in Nankatsu.

143
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:28,710
I wanted you to stay there and play with Tsubasa-kun and the others for a long time.

144
00:09:28,710 --> 00:09:34,720
For Misaki, let's unite on the Japan team. Ozora Tsubasa.

145
00:09:29,170 --> 00:09:34,340
But because of my work, I had to bring you here.

146
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:37,720
For 11 years, I dragged you from place to place.

147
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:42,890
You always had to say goodbye to your friends.

148
00:09:44,390 --> 00:09:45,730
I...

149
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:49,520
Taro, maybe I'm here with you.

150
00:09:49,610 --> 00:09:54,780
But... I can't do anything for you.

151
00:09:55,570 --> 00:09:56,820
Dad.

152
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:00,240
Really, nothing at all.

153
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:07,370
Then, after Sunday's match,

154
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:12,540
Dad and I will go to Yokohama to see my mother.

155
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:17,010
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

156
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:18,990
Born: April 1, Height: 168 cm, Weight: 55 kg, Blood Type: B

157
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,740
Oh, he's here.

158
00:10:25,030 --> 00:10:27,120
Misaki, we've been waiting for you.

159
00:10:27,370 --> 00:10:29,790
Okay Dad, I'm off.

160
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:30,750
Okay.

161
00:10:30,830 --> 00:10:32,000
Guys.

162
00:10:32,290 --> 00:10:34,500
This might be the last time

163
00:10:34,590 --> 00:10:37,340
I watch Taro's match in Japan.

164
00:10:38,050 --> 00:10:39,630
That one, number 11.

165
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:44,510
If we mark the transfer student Misaki, we'll win.

166
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:45,760
Right!

167
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:49,270
Sorry I'm late, guys.

168
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,810
What are you doing here?

169
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:54,270
Didn't you have your English lesson today?

170
00:10:54,610 --> 00:10:56,860
I did, but I skipped it.

171
00:10:56,940 --> 00:11:00,530
I'm also a member of the Nishimine football team.

172
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:02,110
A member, he says.

173
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:06,280
You can only say that if you come to training every day.

174
00:11:06,530 --> 00:11:08,540
You may be right.

175
00:11:08,790 --> 00:11:11,620
Well, it's good you came, but the list is full.

176
00:11:11,710 --> 00:11:13,330
You can't play.

177
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:17,040
You'd better go back to your class before your mom gets mad.

178
00:11:17,590 --> 00:11:22,800
B-But, it's fine, I'll support you from the bench.

179
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:29,060
Nishimine Football Team

180
00:11:26,970 --> 00:11:29,060
Both teams, begin.

181
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:34,690
Good luck!

182
00:11:40,650 --> 00:11:42,240
C-Cut him off!

183
00:11:43,030 --> 00:11:45,780
I can't, he's so fast I can't mark him.

184
00:11:46,870 --> 00:11:48,530
Misaki-kun.

185
00:11:48,990 --> 00:11:50,790
Catch, Kazuo-kun.

186
00:11:50,910 --> 00:11:51,950
Okay.

187
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:53,790
Catch.

188
00:11:55,170 --> 00:11:56,460
We did it.

189
00:11:56,540 --> 00:11:58,540
Your cross was great, Misaki.

190
00:11:58,540 --> 00:12:05,050
Nishimine vs Matsuro

191
00:12:05,590 --> 00:12:11,680
Misaki is really amazing, I wish my football could be as good as his.

192
00:12:12,810 --> 00:12:14,350
End of the first half.

193
00:12:14,730 --> 00:12:17,900
We did it, we're three goals ahead.

194
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:20,070
Misaki is amazing.

195
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:23,150
Alright, let's play like this in the second half too.

196
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,070
Yeah.

197
00:12:25,110 --> 00:12:26,700
Listen, Kazuo-kun.

198
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:30,700
Let Mitsuro-kun play in the second half.

199
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,290
What?

200
00:12:33,370 --> 00:12:36,170
Why Mitsuro!? We're doing well!

201
00:12:36,250 --> 00:12:40,590
But Mitsuro-kun skipped his lesson for the team.

202
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:41,840
But...

203
00:12:42,050 --> 00:12:44,090
I don't want to lose a match we can win.

204
00:12:44,170 --> 00:12:45,840
I won't go out.

205
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:47,840
Then I'll go out.

206
00:12:47,930 --> 00:12:51,970
Are you joking? If you go out, we'll lose.

207
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:53,890
Then I'll go out.

208
00:12:53,970 --> 00:12:54,810
What!?

209
00:12:54,890 --> 00:12:57,350
I think I sprained my ankle.

210
00:12:57,770 --> 00:12:59,900
Yes, good idea.

211
00:13:01,570 --> 00:13:04,570
So Mitsuro, you're playing instead of Koji in the second half.

212
00:13:04,900 --> 00:13:06,320
Yeah.

213
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:08,950
Thank Misaki.

214
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:10,570
Okay.

215
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:12,870
Thanks, Misaki-kun.

216
00:13:12,990 --> 00:13:15,080
- You're welcome. - Mitsuro!

217
00:13:15,580 --> 00:13:17,290
M-Mom.

218
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,120
I knew I'd find you.

219
00:13:19,210 --> 00:13:22,630
You're here again? What are you doing?

220
00:13:22,710 --> 00:13:23,670
But...

221
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:26,510
Players over here, the second half is starting.

222
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,680
Let's go.

223
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:28,840
Mitsuro-kun.

224
00:13:29,010 --> 00:13:32,010
You can come later, get to your lesson.

225
00:13:33,390 --> 00:13:37,980
I'll go home and study, just let me play now.

226
00:13:38,350 --> 00:13:40,350
Wait, Mitsuro!

227
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,230
Who are you?

228
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:46,740
In football, once the match starts, no one is allowed onto the field.

229
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:48,240
But Mitsuro...

230
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:50,740
It's fine.

231
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:55,740
Once in a while, it's good to watch your son run around with other children.

232
00:13:58,540 --> 00:14:00,460
Head it, Mitsuro.

233
00:14:03,170 --> 00:14:04,170
Ah.

234
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:06,880
Wow, what are you doing, Mitsuro?

235
00:14:08,590 --> 00:14:12,340
See? He has no athletic talent.

236
00:14:12,430 --> 00:14:17,220
That's why I'm developing his academic ability, it's a parent's duty.

237
00:14:17,310 --> 00:14:20,140
Absolutely, but...

238
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:23,900
Letting children do what they love makes them happy.

239
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:26,150
Isn't that also a parent's duty?

240
00:14:26,610 --> 00:14:30,240
Look, even when Mitsuro-kun loses the ball, he's happy.

241
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,160
What?

242
00:14:36,410 --> 00:14:37,790
Mitsuro.

243
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,080
S-Sorry, guys.

244
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:42,290
Hang in there, Mitsuro-kun, show us what you can do.

245
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:46,300
Show your mother that you really want to play.

246
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:48,880
Then she'll understand, I'm sure.

247
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:49,800
Okay.

248
00:14:50,050 --> 00:14:50,920
Catch.

249
00:14:53,550 --> 00:14:55,180
What a nice interception.

250
00:14:55,470 --> 00:14:56,560
Mitsuro...

251
00:14:58,180 --> 00:14:59,350
Catch!

252
00:14:59,430 --> 00:15:01,390
Where are you shooting?

253
00:15:01,730 --> 00:15:03,850
Your pass was great, Mitsuro-kun.

254
00:15:03,980 --> 00:15:05,480
- What? - Fast.

255
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:06,570
Misaki-kun!

256
00:15:06,820 --> 00:15:08,570
Run, Mitsuro-kun.

257
00:15:09,150 --> 00:15:10,280
Okay.

258
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:13,200
Alright, let's go forward, guys.

259
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,200
Okay!

260
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:16,200
We're in front of the goal.

261
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:18,790
I want to pass to Mitsuro-kun in front of the goal.

262
00:15:23,210 --> 00:15:25,080
Come on, this is yours!

263
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:29,170
Don't run from it, Mitsuro-kun, dive in!

264
00:15:29,250 --> 00:15:31,090
The ball is your friend.

265
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:32,050
Okay.

266
00:15:37,050 --> 00:15:38,510
He did it!

267
00:15:41,560 --> 00:15:43,640
He could do it! It's a goal!

268
00:15:43,730 --> 00:15:45,230
What a wonderful goal he scored!

269
00:15:45,310 --> 00:15:46,810
Well done, Mitsuro.

270
00:15:46,900 --> 00:15:47,980
You were great.

271
00:15:48,070 --> 00:15:50,190
Truly incredible, Mitsuro.

272
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:54,110
I did it, Mom, I scored a goal.

273
00:15:54,570 --> 00:15:56,660
Oh my, he could do it.

274
00:15:58,990 --> 00:16:00,120
Taro...

275
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:12,010
Taro, I really don't deserve you.

276
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:14,930
You are kind and compassionate.

277
00:16:15,010 --> 00:16:19,390
You are so considerate, you didn't even ask me about your mother.

278
00:16:20,010 --> 00:16:22,890
You must want to see her so much.

279
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:27,520
But from now on, you'll be happy.

280
00:16:28,150 --> 00:16:30,520
You'll be able to play football without moving from place to place.

281
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,740
And you won't have to say goodbye to your friends anymore.

282
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,880
What's wrong? Are you tired?

283
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,550
No, I'm fine.

284
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:56,720
If we go a little further, we should get there.

285
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:57,680
Okay.

286
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:04,180
Yamaoka

287
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,180
This is the place.

288
00:17:04,730 --> 00:17:06,190
Yamaoka.

289
00:17:06,190 --> 00:17:10,690
Yamaoka, Seiji, Yumiko, Yoshiko

290
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:10,690
Yoshiko-san is her current husband's daughter.

291
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,820
Then, she's your little sister.

292
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:15,190
What? Right.

293
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:25,160
Yoshiko-chan, behave.

294
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:27,920
We have a guest today.

295
00:17:32,340 --> 00:17:36,630
She's... just as I imagined.

296
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:40,220
Alright, Taro.

297
00:17:44,810 --> 00:17:46,730
Let's go, Dad.

298
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,060
What?

299
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:53,070
It's okay, let's go, I'm coming to France too.

300
00:17:53,570 --> 00:17:54,570
Taro.

301
00:17:55,150 --> 00:17:59,410
Because... because I am Taro Misaki.

302
00:18:00,610 --> 00:18:02,320
I'm not Taro Yamaoka.

303
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:06,330
I am Taro Misaki.

304
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:08,210
You...

305
00:18:09,870 --> 00:18:12,380
Do you want to come with me, Taro?

306
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:16,460
Yes.

307
00:18:17,670 --> 00:18:22,430
That summer, I went to France and three years later...

308
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:26,680
Tsubasa-kun!

309
00:18:28,930 --> 00:18:32,270
I'm standing on the field next to Tsubasa-kun again.

310
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:36,980
The opening ceremony of the International Youth Tournament

311
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:38,690
has come to an end in France.

312
00:18:38,780 --> 00:18:43,030
And in the opening match, Japan faced Italy.

313
00:18:43,410 --> 00:18:47,040
Japan against Italy, Italy will win of course.

314
00:18:47,120 --> 00:18:50,080
They have a solid defense and Japan has no chance.

315
00:18:50,370 --> 00:18:51,830
What did you say?

316
00:18:53,170 --> 00:18:55,590
How dare you disrespect the Japan team?

317
00:18:55,670 --> 00:19:00,670
Japan's player Misaki is better than any footballer in France.

318
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,090
H-Hey, Azumi.

319
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,590
That's right.

320
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:10,100
Misaki is a great player, he went one-on-one against Pierre.

321
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:12,190
You mean, the famous Pierre?

322
00:19:12,350 --> 00:19:13,600
Who are you guys?

323
00:19:13,980 --> 00:19:16,610
We're Misaki's football friends.

324
00:19:16,690 --> 00:19:19,740
We'll support both France and Japan in this tournament.

325
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:22,110
Really? Thanks.

326
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:27,120
Taro, you have good friends everywhere.

327
00:19:28,370 --> 00:19:30,450
I see, you've made your decision.

328
00:19:30,750 --> 00:19:33,670
Yes, I'll play for the Japan team.

329
00:19:33,750 --> 00:19:37,340
Instead of not trying because I'm afraid of making mistakes,

330
00:19:37,420 --> 00:19:39,960
I decided to try even if it doesn't work out.

331
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:41,470
Taro.

332
00:19:42,050 --> 00:19:44,720
Maybe it's been three years since I played with them,

333
00:19:45,050 --> 00:19:49,100
But I'll still use all my strength the way I know how.

334
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:53,440
It's better to try and regret than not try and regret, right?

335
00:19:59,150 --> 00:20:01,360
Are you really sure you want me?

336
00:20:01,650 --> 00:20:05,320
It wasn't my idea, it was Matsuyama's idea.

337
00:20:05,410 --> 00:20:09,540
Tsubasa, only you are worthy of being captain of the Japan team.

338
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:11,000
Matsuyama-kun.

339
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:13,580
In the second half of the European tournament,

340
00:20:13,660 --> 00:20:16,960
you were the only one holding the team together.

341
00:20:17,130 --> 00:20:19,500
Everyone knows that.

342
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:23,420
It's okay Tsubasa, Matsuyama is saying the same thing.

343
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:25,510
No one objects.

344
00:20:26,010 --> 00:20:27,090
Guys...

345
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:29,510
Then I'll do it.

346
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:36,690
Look, how well the captain's armband suits Tsubasa.

347
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:38,020
Yes, it's right.

348
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:39,730
And one more thing.

349
00:20:42,570 --> 00:20:43,900
Misugi.

350
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:47,280
He's been the team's trainer until now.

351
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:49,780
But I registered him as a player for this tournament.

352
00:20:49,870 --> 00:20:51,790
Guys, I'm counting on your cooperation.

353
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:53,540
Misugi-kun.

354
00:20:53,790 --> 00:20:55,410
Yes, Misugi.

355
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:58,540
Now the Japan team has become even better.

356
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:02,550
Now, our player list for the Italy match.

357
00:21:05,300 --> 00:21:07,380
Forwards: Nitta and Hyuga.

358
00:21:07,470 --> 00:21:08,300
Yes, coach.

359
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:12,390
Midfielders: Tsubasa, Sawada, Tachibana brothers.

360
00:21:12,470 --> 00:21:13,310
Yes, coach.

361
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:17,390
Defenders: Matsuyama, Ishizaki, Soda, and Jito.

362
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,310
Yes, coach.

363
00:21:18,560 --> 00:21:20,560
And goalkeeper: Wakashimazu.

364
00:21:20,650 --> 00:21:22,520
What? Y-Yes, coach.

365
00:21:24,070 --> 00:21:27,200
I entrust Japan's goal to you, Wakashimazu.

366
00:21:27,610 --> 00:21:29,160
Wakabayashi.

367
00:21:30,490 --> 00:21:32,450
- Misaki. - Yes, coach.

368
00:21:32,950 --> 00:21:36,370
You haven't seen this team's game yet.

369
00:21:36,690 --> 00:21:39,480
I want you to watch the first half.

370
00:21:39,810 --> 00:21:42,030
If there's an opportunity in the second half, you'll go in.

371
00:21:42,150 --> 00:21:42,980
Yes, coach.

372
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:45,490
You are now our representatives,

373
00:21:45,780 --> 00:21:49,280
and the representatives of all Japanese footballers.

374
00:21:49,410 --> 00:21:51,410
We believe in you.

375
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,540
Wakabayashi-kun.

376
00:21:53,750 --> 00:21:55,290
- Right. - Good luck.

377
00:21:55,410 --> 00:21:57,540
- We're counting on you. - Leave it to us.

378
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,790
Guys, get ready.

379
00:22:00,210 --> 00:22:02,210
To advance from the group stage,

380
00:22:02,670 --> 00:22:05,550
let's beat Italy today.

381
00:22:05,670 --> 00:22:06,670
Alright!